{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../BusinessOpeningHours/", "title": "BusinessOpeningHours"}, "next": {"link": "../CollectibleItemInfo/", "title": "CollectibleItemInfo"}, "title": "BusinessOpeningHoursInterval", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"businessopeninghoursinterval\">\n<h1>BusinessOpeningHoursInterval<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#businessopeninghoursinterval\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.BusinessOpeningHoursInterval\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BusinessOpeningHoursInterval</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.BusinessOpeningHoursInterval\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>opening_minute</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>) \u2013 The minute\u2019s sequence number in a week, starting on Monday, marking the start of the time interval during which the business is open; 0 - 7 * 24 * 60</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>closing_minute</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>) \u2013 The minute\u2019s sequence number in a week, starting on Monday, marking the end of the time interval during which the business is open; 0 - 8 * 24 * 60</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/Collec